---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import ArrowIcon from '../components/ArrowIcon.astro';
import logoFaces from '../assets/brand/source/step-one-art-logo-faces-original.jpg';
---
<Base
  title="Our purpose"
  description="Step One Art sells artwork made by John Hyder and pieces donated by others. Proceeds help pay rent for residents of sober living."
  current="purpose"
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our purpose</p>
      <h1>Art that helps someone stay.</h1>
    </header>
    <hr class="rule" />
    <div class="layout section">
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          Step One Art is a simple idea: sell good artwork, and use the money to help people who can’t yet afford rent keep a place to
          stay.
        </p>
        <h2>The art</h2>
        <p>
          John Hyder makes artwork, and he also accepts pieces donated by other artists and collectors. Every listing on this site says
          whether it is John’s original work or a donated piece.
        </p>
        <h2>Where the money goes</h2>
        <p>
          Some people living in sober living can’t yet afford their rent. When a piece sells here, the proceeds go toward helping
          those residents pay it.
        </p>
        <p>That’s the whole arrangement. Buying a piece means taking home something you like, and helping someone stay.</p>
        <h2>How buying works</h2>
        <p>
          This site is a showcase, not a shop. There is no checkout. If a piece speaks to you, use the inquiry button on its page to get
          in touch, and the details are worked out directly.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="side">
        <Image
          src={logoFaces}
          alt="The Step One Art logo: winged emblem reading “Step One Art — You are worth it, and you can do it”, with mountains and the name John Hyder, over a background of many drawn faces."
          widths={[320, 480, 640]}
          sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 18rem, 90vw"
          format="webp"
          class="side__logo"
        />
        <p>
          <a class="button" href="/artwork/">See the artwork <ArrowIcon /></a>
        </p>
        <p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/donate-art/">Have a piece to contribute? <ArrowIcon /></a>
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 18rem);
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .lead {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .side__logo {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .side {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .side {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
